      "description": "The meme uses violent horror imagery to mock and threaten individuals who vent anger toward a white person, equating their emotional expression with homicidal rage. This is abusive because it weaponizes violent symbols to demean and intimidate, creating a hostile and threatening tone.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
